{
  "title": "Resting pulse\u2013glucose coupling does not establish incremental fasting-insulin prediction across NHANES samples",
  "abstract": "In 1,786 NHANES 2011\u20132012 and 1,919 separately sampled 2013\u20132014 adults without reported diabetes, adding centered radial pulse \u00d7 fasting glucose to flexible conventional metabolic predictors reduced validation log-insulin MSE by 0.000266 (0.114%); source-refit/target-PSU 95% interval [-0.001621, 0.002872]. Source cross-validation worsened and the gain disappeared against a tensor-interaction baseline. Useful incremental prediction was not established.",
  "keywords": [
    "radial pulse",
    "fasting glucose",
    "insulin",
    "incremental prediction",
    "NHANES",
    "negative result"
  ],
